/**
 *  Whether a brew command can change which packages *exist* — as opposed to
 *  which are installed.
 *
 *  Only these justify refetching the full catalogs (`brew formulae` and
 *  `brew casks`), which AGENTS.md documents as 80+ seconds cold. Installing,
